<!DOCTYPE suzuki [
<!ENTITY % sdatacharaents SYSTEM "..\config8\sdatacharaents.txt">
%sdatacharaents;
]>
<suzuki><manual>
<section sectnbr = "1K">
<servcat sctnbr = "01" scnbr = "11">
<configtype typenbr = "0">
<servinfotype sitcode = "6">
<servinfo servinfosgmlid = "AENLBA0C1B06002" svcinfotypenbr = "08" svcinfoqualnbr = "01" page = "2" supplyoff = "1" modify = "0">
<title>
Exhaust Manifold Removal and Installation
</title>
<ptxt>
<intxrefpoff refid = "AENLBA0C1B06001">Exhaust System Components</intxrefpoff>
</ptxt>
<attention2>
<ptxt>
Touching a hot exhaust system component will cause a burn.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Do not perform any service work on the exhaust system until the exhaust system is cool.
</ptxt>
</attention2>
<servinfosub id = "AENLBA0C1B06002001" page = "2">
<title>
Removal
</title>
<attention4>
<ptxt>
Applying a shock to the exhaust manifold may cause damage to the three-way catalytic converter inside the exhaust manifold.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Handle the exhaust manifold carefully. Be careful not to drop it or hit it against something.
</ptxt>
</attention4>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove HO2S-1 and HO2S-2 clamps (1).
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1 page = "2">
<ptxt>
Disconnect HO2S-1 (2) and HO2S-2 (3) connectors and then detach from HO2S bracket (4).
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove HO2S-1 and HO2S-2, if necessary. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLBA0C1306014"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1 page = "2">
<ptxt>
Remove caution plate (5) from exhaust manifold.
</ptxt>
<figure page = "2">
<graphic graphicname = "IJHA0A1B0002.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "54.429mm" ver = "01" gw = "199" gh = "138"/>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1 page = "2">
<ptxt>
Remove exhaust No.1 pipe (1) from exhaust manifold.
</ptxt>
<figure page = "2">
<graphic graphicname = "I7V20A1B1003.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "51.237mm" ver = "01" gw = "163" gh = "129"/>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1 page = "2">
<ptxt>
Remove exhaust manifold stiffener No.1 (1).
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove exhaust manifold stiffener No.2 (2).
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1 page = "2">
<ptxt>
Remove bolts and nuts and then remove exhaust manifold (3) and its gasket from cylinder head.
</ptxt>
<figure page = "2">
<graphic graphicname = "IFRA0A1B1003.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "60.102mm" ver = "01" gw = "199" gh = "154"/>
</figure>
</s1>
</servinfosub>
<servinfosub id = "AENLBA0C1B06002002" page = "2">
<title>
Installation
</title>
<ptxt>
<intxrefpoff refid = "AENLBA0C1B06003">Exhaust Manifold Inspection</intxrefpoff>
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Reverse removal procedure noting the following points.
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Use new gasket and seal ring.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Tighten exhaust manifold bolts (1) and nuts (2) to specified torque.
</ptxt>
<torque>
<torqueitem id = "T1K001">
<t-part>
Exhaust manifold bolt
</t-part>
<t-part1>
a
</t-part1>
<t-value1>
60
</t-value1>
<t-value2>
6.1
</t-value2>
<t-value3>
44.5
</t-value3>
</torqueitem>
<torqueitem id = "T1K002">
<t-part>
Exhaust manifold nut
</t-part>
<t-part1>
b
</t-part1>
<t-value1>
60
</t-value1>
<t-value2>
6.1
</t-value2>
<t-value3>
44.5
</t-value3>
</torqueitem>
</torque>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IFRA0A1B1004.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "54.514mm" ver = "01" gw = "223" gh = "138"/>
</figure>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Install HO2S-1 and HO2S-2, if removed. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLBA0C1306014"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Install exhaust manifold stiffeners as follows.
</ptxt>
</item>
<list2 type = "ordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Install exhaust manifold stiffener No.1 (1) and No.2 (2), then tighten exhaust manifold stiffener No.1 nut (3) and No.2 nut (4) by hand.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Fully tighten all bolts and nuts in numerical order (“1” – “4”).
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IGSB0A1B3003.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "58.832mm" ver = "01" gw = "199" gh = "150"/>
</figure>
</item>
</list2>
<item>
<ptxt>
Tighten exhaust pipe bolts to specified torque.
</ptxt>
<torque>
<torqueitem id = "T1K003">
<t-part>
Exhaust pipe bolt
</t-part>
<t-part1>
a
</t-part1>
<t-value1>
43
</t-value1>
<t-value2>
4.4
</t-value2>
<t-value3>
32.0
</t-value3>
</torqueitem>
</torque>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "I9P60A1B1004.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "54.949mm" ver = "01" gw = "153" gh = "139"/>
</figure>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Run engine and check for exhaust gas leakage.
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</servinfosub>
</servinfo>
</servinfotype>
</configtype>
</servcat>
</section></manual></suzuki>
